### ============================================================
### 1. AUTH
### ============================================================

### [Auth] Register — happy path → 200 AuthResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.dev",
  "password": "Password123",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

###

### [Auth] Register — email đã tồn tại → 409 {"error":"EMAIL_TAKEN"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.dev",
  "password": "Password123",
  "displayName": "Test User 2"
}

###

### [Auth] Register — password quá ngắn → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED / TOO_SHORT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new@local.dev",
  "password": "123",
  "displayName": "Short"
}

###

### [Auth] Login → paste accessToken và refreshToken vào variables
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.dev",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

### [Auth] Login — sai mật khẩu → 401 {"error":"INVALID_CREDENTIALS"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@local.dev",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

###

### [Auth] Refresh token → paste accessToken mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### [Auth] Logout → 204 No Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###


### ============================================================
### 2. WALLETS
### ============================================================

### [Wallets] List → 200 array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Wallets] Tạo ví thường → 201, paste walletId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ví Da",
  "type": "Regular",
  "initialBalance": 500000,
  "currency": "VND",
  "icon": "wallet",
  "color": "#4CAF50"
}

###

### [Wallets] Tạo ví tín dụng → 201, paste creditWalletId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa TCB",
  "type": "Credit",
  "creditLimit": 50000000,
  "currency": "VND"
}

###

### [Wallets] Credit wallet thiếu creditLimit → 400 {"error":"INVALID_CREDIT_LIMIT"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Thẻ Không Hạn Mức",
  "type": "Credit"
}

###

### [Wallets] GET by id → 200 WalletResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Wallets] GET not found → 404 {"error":"NOT_FOUND"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Wallets] Update wallet → 200 WalletResponse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ví Da (cập nhật)",
  "icon": "wallet",
  "color": "#2196F3"
}

###

### [Wallets] Xóa ví → 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


### ============================================================
### 3. CATEGORIES
### ============================================================

### [Categories] List → bao gồm 4 system categories (isSystem=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] GET system category DEBT_LEND → isSystem=true, systemKey="DEBT_LEND"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{debtLendId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] Tạo category Expense (AppliesToAllWallets=true) → 201, paste categoryId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ăn uống",
  "type": "Expense",
  "appliesToAllWallets": true,
  "icon": "food",
  "color": "#FF5722"
}

###

### [Categories] Tạo category Expense con → 201, paste childCategoryId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cà phê",
  "type": "Expense",
  "parentId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "appliesToAllWallets": true
}

###

### [Categories] Tạo category Income với assign wallet → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lương",
  "type": "Income",
  "appliesToAllWallets": false,
  "assignToWalletIds": ["{{walletId}}"]
}

###

### [Categories] Parent type mismatch → 400 {"error":"PARENT_TYPE_MISMATCH"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tiền lương con",
  "type": "Income",
  "parentId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

###

### [Categories] UPDATE user category → 200 CategoryResponse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ăn uống (cập nhật)",
  "appliesToAllWallets": true,
  "icon": "restaurant",
  "color": "#E91E63"
}

###

### [Categories] UPDATE system category → 403 {"error":"SYSTEM_CATEGORY_READ_ONLY"}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{debtLendId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hack tên",
  "appliesToAllWallets": true
}

###

### [Categories] GET wallets của system category (AppliesToAllWallets=true) → list all wallet IDs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{debtLendId}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] GET wallets của user category → list assigned wallet IDs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] Tạo category chỉ assign ví cụ thể (dùng để test CATEGORY_NOT_ASSIGNED_TO_WALLET)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chi phí Visa",
  "type": "Expense",
  "appliesToAllWallets": false,
  "assignToWalletIds": ["{{creditWalletId}}"]
}

###

### [Categories] PUT wallets assignment → 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

["{{walletId}}"]

###

### [Categories] DELETE category có child → 400 {"error":"HAS_CHILDREN"}
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] DELETE category con → 204 (xóa child trước)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{childCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


### ============================================================
### 4. TRANSACTIONS
### ============================================================

### [Transactions] POST Expense — AppliesToAllWallets=true, không cần participant → 201, paste transactionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 85000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-15T08:30:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "note": "Bún bò buổi sáng"
}

###

### [Transactions] POST Debt LEND với participantId → 201 (participant trong response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-20T14:00:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{debtLendId}}",
  "participantId": "{{participantId}}",
  "note": "Cho Anh Bảy mượn"
}

###

### [Transactions] POST Debt LEND không participantId → 201, server auto-fill "Ai đó"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-22T16:00:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{debtLendId}}",
  "note": "Cho ai đó mượn"
}

###

### [Transactions] POST Income → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 15000000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-01T09:00:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "note": "Lương tháng 5"
}

###

### [Transactions] POST category chưa assign vào wallet → 400 {"error":"CATEGORY_NOT_ASSIGNED_TO_WALLET"}
### (dùng category chỉ assign creditWalletId nhưng post với walletId thường)
### Thay categoryId bên dưới bằng ID của "Chi phí Visa" category tạo ở trên
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-25T10:00:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "PASTE_VISA_CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "note": "Sẽ bị lỗi"
}

###

### [Transactions] GET list — date range toàn năm → flat list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Transactions] GET list — filter theo walletId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&walletId={{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Transactions] GET list — filter theo categoryId (debt)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&categoryId={{debtLendId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Transactions] GET list — filter theo participantId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&participantId={{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Transactions] GET by id → 200 TransactionResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Transactions] PUT update → 200 TransactionResponse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 90000,
  "occurredAt": "2026-05-15T09:00:00Z",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "note": "Bún bò + nước"
}

###

### [Transactions] DELETE soft → 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Categories] DELETE category có transaction → 400 {"error":"HAS_TRANSACTIONS"}
### (thử xóa category đang được dùng bởi các transactions chưa bị xóa)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


### ============================================================
### 5. PARTICIPANTS
### ============================================================

### [Participants] GET list → "Ai đó" (isDefault=true) đứng đầu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Participants] POST tạo participant mới → 201, paste participantId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anh Bảy",
  "note": "Bạn học cũ"
}

###

### [Participants] POST trùng tên → 409 {"error":"PARTICIPANT_NAME_TAKEN"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anh Bảy"
}

###

### [Participants] GET by id → 200 ParticipantResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Participants] PUT update → 200 ParticipantResponse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anh Bảy (họ hàng)",
  "note": "Cập nhật ghi chú"
}

###


### ============================================================
### 6. SYNC
### ============================================================

### [Sync] Pull — first sync (no since) → tất cả entities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/pull
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Sync] Pull — incremental (since timestamp)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/pull?since=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Sync] Push — upsert wallet mới + transaction mới → applied
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{syncBatchId}}",
  "deviceId": "test-device-http",
  "changes": {
    "wallets": [
      {
        "id": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
        "op": "upsert",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T00:00:00Z",
        "data": {
          "name": "Ví Sync Test",
          "type": "Regular",
          "initialBalance": 0,
          "currency": "VND"
        }
      }
    ],
    "transactions": [
      {
        "id": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
        "op": "upsert",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T00:00:00Z",
        "data": {
          "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
          "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
          "amount": 55000,
          "occurredAt": "2026-05-29T07:00:00Z",
          "note": "Pushed từ client"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

###

### [Sync] Push — cùng batchId → 200 với response y hệt (không duplicate trong DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{syncBatchId}}",
  "deviceId": "test-device-http",
  "changes": {
    "wallets": [
      {
        "id": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
        "op": "upsert",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T00:00:00Z",
        "data": {
          "name": "Ví Sync Test",
          "type": "Regular",
          "initialBalance": 0,
          "currency": "VND"
        }
      }
    ],
    "transactions": [
      {
        "id": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
        "op": "upsert",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T00:00:00Z",
        "data": {
          "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
          "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
          "amount": 55000,
          "occurredAt": "2026-05-29T07:00:00Z",
          "note": "Pushed từ client"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

###

### [Sync] Push — batch với validation error → 400 SYNC_BATCH_REJECTED (dùng batchId mới)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "changes": {
    "categories": [
      {
        "id": "{{debtLendId}}",
        "op": "upsert",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T00:00:00Z",
        "data": { "name": "Hack system" }
      }
    ]
  }
}

###


### ============================================================
### 7. REPORTS
### ============================================================

### [Reports] Monthly tháng 5/2026 → totalIncome, totalExpense, byCategory, topExpenses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Reports] Yearly 2026 → 12 MonthlySummary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/yearly?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Reports] Debt report → theyOweMe + iOweThem (outstanding > 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/debt
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
